\documentclass{article}
\title{Wall-Resolved Large Eddy Simulation of Channel Flow}
\author{B. Okafor and M. Virtanen}
\date{February 2026}
\begin{document}
\maketitle
\section{Grid Convergence}
Three nested grids are used to assess the discretisation error of the solver.
Once the friction Reynolds number } exceeds the calibration range of the subgrid model,
the predicted skin friction drifts systematically away from the direct numerical
simulation data used as a reference.
Refining the grid near the wall restores agreement to within two percent.
\end{document}

